  "chapter": 8,
  "verse_number": 11,
  "text_sanskrit": "यदक्षरं वेदविदो वदन्ति विशन्ति यद्यतयो वीतरागाः । यदिच्छन्तो ब्रह्मचर्यं चरन्ति तत्ते पदं सङ्ग्रहेण प्रवक्ष्ये ॥ ८-११ ॥",
  "itrans": "yadakSharaM vedavido vadanti vishanti yadyatayo vItarAgAH . yadichChanto brahmacharya.n charanti tatte padaM sa~NgraheNa pravakShye .. 8-11 ..",
  "translation": "The goal, which is absolutely indestructible, those versed in the Vedas declare, which the ascetics free from passions enter, desiring which they practise Brahmacharya—that goal I shall briefly describe to thee. (11)",
